WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.887
How OpenFile keeps your files private.

2
00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:09.995
What really happens when you drop a file into OpenFile, why nothing gets

3
00:00:09.995 --> 00:00:13.771
uploaded, and how you can check it yourself in two minutes.

4
00:00:16.106 --> 00:00:20.434
What does get downloaded. Some tools need a heavy engine the first time

5
00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:21.226
you use them.

6
00:00:23.462 --> 00:00:25.783
The few things that are not local.

7
00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:27.558
I want to be precise here.

8
00:00:29.794 --> 00:00:34.995
Why I built it this way. Most free file tools on the web upload your document

9
00:00:34.995 --> 00:00:39.927
to a server, process it there, and ask you to trust that it gets deleted.

10
00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:45.061
To try it, open Merge PDF in OpenFile.

11
00:00:45.061 --> 00:00:49.409
Drop in a file, adjust the settings and press the button.

12
00:00:49.409 --> 00:00:53.299
It all runs on your device, so nothing is uploaded.

13
00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:59.700
Read the full post, with live demos, on the OpenFile blog.
